  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Sri Lanka Delegation(2024 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Sri Lanka, the ICRC helps people affected by the past conflict, including detainees, the families of missing persons and economically vulnerable households. We also work with ministries, armed forces, police and universities to promote IHL and international human rights law. Read more about the ICRC in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </description>
